---
// input: None (static FAQ accordion list)
// output: Accessible accordion list addressing top search intent questions in English
// pos: src/components/FAQ.astro (更新规则：文件变更需同步本注释与所属目录 README)

export const FAQS = [
  {
    q: "What is the Soul Virtues Extractor?",
    a: "The Soul Virtues Extractor is a weighted, multi-dimensional assessment featuring 66 questions based on the seven human soul traits from Undertale: Determination (Red), Bravery (Orange), Justice (Yellow), Kindness (Green), Patience (Cyan), Integrity (Blue), and Perseverance (Purple). Unlike simple single-result quizzes, it calculates your complete percentage distribution across all seven virtues."
  },
  {
    q: "How many questions are in the Soul Virtues Test?",
    a: "The full test consists of 66 carefully calibrated statements. Each question uses a 5-point Likert scale (from Strongly Disagree to Strongly Agree) or specialized response choices. Answering Neutral acts as a skip without adding or subtracting points."
  },
  {
    q: "How is my score calculated across all seven virtues?",
    a: "Every answer adds or subtracts weighted points across multiple virtues simultaneously. Total raw scores are normalized against the theoretical maximum for each virtue and adjusted via a mathematical power curve (curve factor 0.6) where 50% represents exact neutrality. Scores above 50% indicate positive affinity, while scores below 50% represent lower alignment."
  },
  {
    q: "Can I have more than one dominant Soul Virtue?",
    a: "Yes. Human character is multi-dimensional. Your final results display your full percentage profile across all seven traits. Many people discover high affinity in two or three virtues simultaneously (for example, High Kindness paired with High Integrity)."
  },
  {
    q: "Is this an Undertale Soul Test or a Deltarune Soul Test?",
    a: "The seven soul colors and virtues originate directly from the classic Undertale lore created by Toby Fox (Determination, Bravery, Justice, Kindness, Patience, Integrity, Perseverance). The community also frequently references these traits in Deltarune soul theories."
  },
  {
    q: "Are my answers and test results private?",
    a: "Yes, 100% private. All quiz calculations run entirely inside your web browser using client-side JavaScript. No responses, scores, or personal identifiers are stored or transmitted to external servers."
  },
  {
    q: "How can I share my Soul Virtues result card?",
    a: "Upon completing the 66 questions, the tool generates a pixel-art Soul Card with your dominant virtue color and full percentage bar chart. Click 'Download Result Card' to save a high-resolution PNG image, or click 'Copy Summary' to paste your breakdown directly to Twitter, Reddit, or Discord."
  },
  {
    q: "Is this assessment free to use?",
    a: "Yes, Soul Virtues Extractor is 100% free with no registration, no paywall, and no hidden subscriptions."
  }
];
---

<div class="space-y-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
  {FAQS.map((faq) => (
    <details class="group bg-[#121420] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-gray-700">
      <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none text-base font-semibold text-white group-open:text-red-400">
        <span class="pr-4">{faq.q}</span>
        <span class="transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-400">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
          </svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-gray-800/80 pt-4">
        {faq.a}
      </p>
    </details>
  ))}
</div>

